{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your body is the controller.</h2>Catch Flex is a rhythm game where you move to the music using your whole body. Your movements are tracked with a regular camera \u2014 webcam or phone \u2014 no VR headset required.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br><strong>Cut Blocks</strong><br>Slash through blocks with your hand or foot. Match the arrow direction for bonus points.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/3c95156aeb6add62ae53096a6c5c6f40.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/3c95156aeb6add62ae53096a6c5c6f40.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/3c95156aeb6add62ae53096a6c5c6f40.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Collect Rings</strong><br>Step on floor rings with your feet. Grab air rings with your hands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/7b415d3da4946c02d2647d828dbf9e13.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/7b415d3da4946c02d2647d828dbf9e13.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/7b415d3da4946c02d2647d828dbf9e13.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dodge Obstacles</strong><br>Step over low barriers or move around them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/bd8cdf54553c1f2aaa579ddb3fac2c06.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/bd8cdf54553c1f2aaa579ddb3fac2c06.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/bd8cdf54553c1f2aaa579ddb3fac2c06.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Kick Balls</strong><br>Kick with either foot \u2014 or get creative with your hand or head.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/cdf11453e20bac6305d4ff6eeee600a6.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/cdf11453e20bac6305d4ff6eeee600a6.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/cdf11453e20bac6305d4ff6eeee600a6.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/6d6a6cff018c3e291384557de9f76095.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/6d6a6cff018c3e291384557de9f76095.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/6d6a6cff018c3e291384557de9f76095.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Move the cursor with your right hand. To click, raise your left hand above your head and hold until the button fills. To pause during gameplay, raise both hands and bring them together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Body Tracking</h2>Real-time body tracking from a single camera is challenging \u2014 perfect accuracy and zero latency aren't possible with current technology. The game is designed to feel responsive within these limits.<br><br><strong>For best results:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Good lighting<br></li><li>Avoid black or very loose clothing<br></li><li>Keep your full body visible to the camera</li></ul><br>If your PC struggles with tracking, use the companion phone app instead \u2014 both devices need to be on the same Wi-Fi network.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2>This is a solo dev project in active development. Mechanics, content, and feel will evolve based on player feedback. Try the demo, see if it clicks, and let me know what you think.<br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670810?t=1772557309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/d8e13abaa7b07424e973286b96181f542331b906/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772557309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/3f76045b9a9c56c91582042ee106cd72a9b45e8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772557309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/3f76045b9a9c56c91582042ee106cd72a9b45e8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772557309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3692800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your body is the controller.</h2>Catch Flex is a rhythm game where you move to the music using your whole body. Your movements are tracked with a regular camera \u2014 webcam or phone \u2014 no VR headset required.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br><strong>Cut Blocks</strong><br>Slash through blocks with your hand or foot. Match the arrow direction for bonus points.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/3c95156aeb6add62ae53096a6c5c6f40.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/3c95156aeb6add62ae53096a6c5c6f40.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/3c95156aeb6add62ae53096a6c5c6f40.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Collect Rings</strong><br>Step on floor rings with your feet. Grab air rings with your hands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/7b415d3da4946c02d2647d828dbf9e13.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/7b415d3da4946c02d2647d828dbf9e13.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/7b415d3da4946c02d2647d828dbf9e13.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dodge Obstacles</strong><br>Step over low barriers or move around them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/bd8cdf54553c1f2aaa579ddb3fac2c06.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/bd8cdf54553c1f2aaa579ddb3fac2c06.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/bd8cdf54553c1f2aaa579ddb3fac2c06.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Kick Balls</strong><br>Kick with either foot \u2014 or get creative with your hand or head.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/cdf11453e20bac6305d4ff6eeee600a6.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/cdf11453e20bac6305d4ff6eeee600a6.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/cdf11453e20bac6305d4ff6eeee600a6.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/6d6a6cff018c3e291384557de9f76095.poster.avif?t=1772557309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/6d6a6cff018c3e291384557de9f76095.webm?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/extras/6d6a6cff018c3e291384557de9f76095.mp4?t=1772557309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Move the cursor with your right hand. To click, raise your left hand above your head and hold until the button fills. To pause during gameplay, raise both hands and bring them together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Body Tracking</h2>Real-time body tracking from a single camera is challenging \u2014 perfect accuracy and zero latency aren't possible with current technology. The game is designed to feel responsive within these limits.<br><br><strong>For best results:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Good lighting<br></li><li>Avoid black or very loose clothing<br></li><li>Keep your full body visible to the camera</li></ul><br>If your PC struggles with tracking, use the companion phone app instead \u2014 both devices need to be on the same Wi-Fi network.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2>This is a solo dev project in active development. Mechanics, content, and feel will evolve based on player feedback. Try the demo, see if it clicks, and let me know what you think.<br>","developers":[" Catch Flex"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670810/ab483bd22cfcb56f2d5f734fcd4b8c73a2362252/header.jpg?t=1772557309","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam OS</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Sequoia</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670810/224694676/e09cfe87af8ad60c0ff34dc6d3cebcf98f0ba637/1770873885/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770874643","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670810/224694676/e09cfe87af8ad60c0ff34dc6d3cebcf98f0ba637/1770873885/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770874643","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3670810/224694676/e09cfe87af8ad60c0ff34dc6d3cebcf98f0ba637/1770873885/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770874643","id":257269814,"name":"Gameplay & Features","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app